                                                "sense_id": "426414fe-8236-316e-a613-ea0c1c95d539",
                                                "text": "All the kneelers sighed with relief when they were told it was over and they could finally stand up."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d699dba-488c-39bf-ac11-9ea61ad99f66",
                                        "entry_id": "8100c457-d17b-3870-9c01-9977c4b23a8c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hassock."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5410aedb-59fc-49e7-8d26-44263873cdac",
                                                "sense_id": "4d699dba-488c-39bf-ac11-9ea61ad99f66",
                                                "text": "The parish deacon was always pushing to get new kneelers for the church, probably because he was old and his knees were sensitive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5be82f9-9c50-43e0-93e7-7d29ef05c485",
                                                "sense_id": "4d699dba-488c-39bf-ac11-9ea61ad99f66",
                                                "text": "The benches are scuffed Victorian, and lying on them are sets of kneelers embroidered by parishioners."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
